{"id":"vol8-04","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-04/audio-4.m4a","model":"small","duration":457.11,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":3.06,"text":"Now turn to section 4 on page 6.","words":[["Now",0.0,0.24],["turn",0.24,0.54],["to",0.54,0.74],["section",0.74,1.0],["4",1.0,1.56],["on",1.56,2.22],["page",2.22,2.52],["6.",2.52,3.06]]},{"start":5.56,"end":10.52,"text":"Section 4 You will hear a museum curator giving a presentation","words":[["Section",5.56,5.76],["4",5.76,6.28],["You",6.28,7.58],["will",7.58,7.74],["hear",7.74,8.0],["a",8.0,8.22],["museum",8.22,8.56],["curator",8.56,9.32],["giving",9.32,9.78],["a",9.78,10.04],["presentation",10.04,10.52]]},{"start":10.52,"end":17.04,"text":"about her museum's collection of perfume containers, also known as perfume ornaments.","words":[["about",10.52,11.22],["her",11.22,11.48],["museum's",11.48,12.24],["collection",12.24,12.64],["of",12.64,13.06],["perfume",13.06,13.46],["containers,",13.46,14.18],["also",14.66,15.02],["known",15.02,15.4],["as",15.4,15.96],["perfume",15.96,16.42],["ornaments.",16.42,17.04]]},{"start":18.46,"end":24.56,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40 on pages 6 and 7.","words":[["First",18.46,19.24],["you",19.24,19.42],["have",19.42,19.58],["some",19.58,19.76],["time",19.76,20.14],["to",20.14,20.36],["look",20.36,20.48],["at",20.48,20.62],["questions",20.62,20.92],["31",20.92,21.74],["to",21.74,21.98],["40",21.98,22.4],["on",22.4,23.12],["pages",23.12,23.42],["6",23.42,23.88],["and",23.88,24.2],["7.",24.2,24.56]]},{"start":65.0,"end":68.72,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["Now",65.0,65.34],["listen",65.34,65.64],["carefully",65.64,66.1],["and",66.1,66.46],["answer",66.46,66.82],["questions",66.82,67.24],["31",67.24,68.06],["to",68.06,68.32],["40.",68.32,68.72]]},{"start":68.72,"end":68.84,"text":"me.","words":[["me.",68.72,68.84]]},{"start":72.18,"end":78.08,"text":"Good morning and welcome to the Walden Gallery. In today's open lecture, I'm going to be","words":[["Good",72.18,72.66],["morning",72.66,73.12],["and",73.12,73.6],["welcome",73.6,74.06],["to",74.06,74.34],["the",74.34,74.46],["Walden",74.46,74.82],["Gallery.",74.82,75.26],["In",75.94,76.14],["today's",76.14,76.54],["open",76.54,76.78],["lecture,",76.78,77.24],["I'm",77.54,77.66],["going",77.66,77.82],["to",77.82,77.98],["be",77.98,78.08]]},{"start":78.08,"end":84.5,"text":"talking about our collection of perfume ornaments or containers. These beautiful objects now","words":[["talking",78.08,78.36],["about",78.36,78.72],["our",78.72,78.92],["collection",78.92,79.34],["of",79.34,79.6],["perfume",79.6,80.0],["ornaments",80.0,80.52],["or",80.52,81.16],["containers.",81.16,81.68],["These",82.54,82.86],["beautiful",82.86,83.4],["objects",83.4,83.98],["now",83.98,84.5]]},{"start":84.5,"end":90.34,"text":"form a significant part of the museum's collection and are very popular with the public. But","words":[["form",84.5,84.84],["a",84.84,85.02],["significant",85.02,85.5],["part",85.5,85.9],["of",85.9,86.08],["the",86.08,86.18],["museum's",86.18,86.74],["collection",86.74,87.1],["and",87.1,87.82],["are",87.82,87.98],["very",87.98,88.2],["popular",88.2,88.66],["with",88.66,88.9],["the",88.9,89.0],["public.",89.0,89.26],["But",89.82,90.34]]},{"start":90.34,"end":95.4,"text":"this has not always been the case. Up until relatively recently, the large collection","words":[["this",90.34,90.82],["has",90.82,91.06],["not",91.06,91.26],["always",91.26,91.6],["been",91.6,91.82],["the",91.82,91.94],["case.",91.94,92.28],["Up",92.86,93.14],["until",93.14,93.38],["relatively",93.38,93.72],["recently,",93.72,94.3],["the",94.66,94.72],["large",94.72,95.0],["collection",95.0,95.4]]},{"start":95.4,"end":100.26,"text":"of perfume ornaments held in store, donated by Lady Walden at the beginning of the last","words":[["of",95.4,95.58],["perfume",95.58,95.9],["ornaments",95.9,96.38],["held",96.38,96.68],["in",96.68,96.88],["store,",96.88,97.24],["donated",97.6,98.06],["by",98.06,98.36],["Lady",98.36,98.6],["Walden",98.6,99.08],["at",99.08,99.26],["the",99.26,99.36],["beginning",99.36,99.6],["of",99.6,99.88],["the",99.88,100.0],["last",100.0,100.26]]},{"start":100.26,"end":105.42,"text":"century was not considered to be of much interest and was not on show to the general public.","words":[["century",100.26,100.72],["was",100.72,101.32],["not",101.32,101.62],["considered",101.62,102.08],["to",102.08,102.34],["be",102.34,102.48],["of",102.48,102.58],["much",102.58,102.78],["interest",102.78,103.18],["and",103.18,103.66],["was",103.66,103.84],["not",103.84,104.06],["on",104.06,104.22],["show",104.22,104.5],["to",104.5,104.64],["the",104.64,104.76],["general",104.76,105.04],["public.",105.04,105.42]]},{"start":106.06,"end":112.44,"text":"Then as late as 1989, a visiting professor from the Victoria and Albert Museum commented","words":[["Then",106.06,106.46],["as",106.46,106.84],["late",106.84,107.08],["as",107.08,107.26],["1989,",107.26,108.02],["a",108.62,108.84],["visiting",108.84,109.14],["professor",109.14,109.7],["from",109.7,110.02],["the",110.02,110.14],["Victoria",110.14,110.56],["and",110.56,110.86],["Albert",110.86,111.06],["Museum",111.06,111.54],["commented",111.54,112.44]]},{"start":112.44,"end":117.76,"text":"that some of the objects were worth a great deal, and so the display was created much","words":[["that",112.44,112.98],["some",112.98,113.2],["of",113.2,113.32],["the",113.32,113.4],["objects",113.4,113.84],["were",113.84,114.04],["worth",114.04,114.28],["a",114.28,114.42],["great",114.42,114.6],["deal,",114.6,114.92],["and",115.16,115.62],["so",115.62,115.92],["the",115.92,116.1],["display",116.1,116.44],["was",116.44,116.7],["created",116.7,117.16],["much",117.16,117.76]]},{"start":117.76,"end":119.02,"text":"as you see it here today.","words":[["as",117.76,118.0],["you",118.0,118.12],["see",118.12,118.32],["it",118.32,118.5],["here",118.5,118.68],["today.",118.68,119.02]]},{"start":120.02,"end":124.56,"text":"Now before I say anything more about their perfume containers, I thought I'd briefly","words":[["Now",120.02,120.38],["before",120.38,120.64],["I",120.64,120.86],["say",120.86,121.06],["anything",121.06,121.42],["more",121.42,121.78],["about",121.78,122.02],["their",122.02,122.18],["perfume",122.18,122.52],["containers,",122.52,123.08],["I",123.54,123.86],["thought",123.86,124.06],["I'd",124.06,124.28],["briefly",124.28,124.56]]},{"start":124.56,"end":128.0,"text":"touch on the background to the development of perfumes themselves.","words":[["touch",124.56,124.9],["on",124.9,125.1],["the",125.1,125.2],["background",125.2,125.68],["to",125.68,125.98],["the",125.98,126.1],["development",126.1,126.46],["of",126.46,126.8],["perfumes",126.8,127.4],["themselves.",127.4,128.0]]},{"start":128.0,"end":133.04,"text":"In the West, perfumery really began as late as the 11th century.","words":[["In",128.0,129.0],["the",129.0,129.12],["West,",129.12,129.42],["perfumery",129.5,130.18],["really",130.18,130.88],["began",130.88,131.26],["as",131.26,131.56],["late",131.56,131.78],["as",131.78,131.92],["the",131.92,132.06],["11th",132.06,133.04],["century.",133.04,133.04]]},{"start":133.64,"end":137.08,"text":"Bathing and laundering were considered hazardous undertakings,","words":[["Bathing",133.64,134.1],["and",134.1,134.22],["laundering",134.22,134.66],["were",134.66,134.86],["considered",134.86,135.28],["hazardous",135.28,136.0],["undertakings,",136.0,137.08]]},{"start":137.4,"end":142.22,"text":"because even though there were ample supplies of water, it was often dirty or even infected.","words":[["because",137.4,137.64],["even",137.64,137.92],["though",137.92,138.14],["there",138.14,138.3],["were",138.3,138.42],["ample",138.42,138.78],["supplies",138.78,139.2],["of",139.2,139.44],["water,",139.44,139.74],["it",140.2,140.32],["was",140.32,140.44],["often",140.44,140.74],["dirty",140.74,141.14],["or",141.14,141.5],["even",141.5,141.78],["infected.",141.78,142.22]]},{"start":142.86,"end":147.28,"text":"As a consequence, as you can imagine, the air was heavy with unpleasant smells,","words":[["As",142.86,143.04],["a",143.04,143.12],["consequence,",143.12,143.62],["as",143.9,143.96],["you",143.96,144.08],["can",144.08,144.2],["imagine,",144.2,144.54],["the",144.94,145.04],["air",145.04,145.26],["was",145.26,145.54],["heavy",145.54,145.94],["with",145.94,146.24],["unpleasant",146.24,146.72],["smells,",146.72,147.28]]},{"start":147.66,"end":149.74,"text":"which had to be countered or covered up.","words":[["which",147.66,147.98],["had",147.98,148.16],["to",148.16,148.24],["be",148.24,148.36],["countered",148.36,149.02],["or",149.02,149.2],["covered",149.2,149.46],["up.",149.46,149.74]]},{"start":150.54,"end":154.04,"text":"In those early days, perfumes were in solid form","words":[["In",150.54,150.86],["those",150.86,151.06],["early",151.06,151.4],["days,",151.4,151.74],["perfumes",152.34,152.76],["were",152.76,153.0],["in",153.0,153.18],["solid",153.18,153.56],["form",153.56,154.04]]},{"start":154.04,"end":160.96,"text":"and mainly made from spices, leaves and animal fixatives in paste form, for example musk","words":[["and",154.04,154.4],["mainly",154.4,154.82],["made",154.82,155.1],["from",155.1,155.32],["spices,",155.32,155.86],["leaves",156.42,156.84],["and",156.84,157.42],["animal",157.42,157.92],["fixatives",157.92,158.5],["in",158.5,158.78],["paste",158.78,159.1],["form,",159.1,159.42],["for",159.8,159.92],["example",159.92,160.28],["musk",160.28,160.96]]},{"start":160.96,"end":167.24,"text":"and ambergris. Wealthy people, the only people who could afford them, carried small globular","words":[["and",160.96,161.2],["ambergris.",161.2,162.12],["Wealthy",162.74,163.24],["people,",163.24,163.52],["the",163.94,164.12],["only",164.12,164.32],["people",164.32,164.58],["who",164.58,164.78],["could",164.78,164.92],["afford",164.92,165.16],["them,",165.16,165.4],["carried",165.8,166.04],["small",166.04,166.58],["globular",166.58,167.24]]},{"start":167.24,"end":173.18,"text":"vessels known as pommenders. I've brought out one ornament from the collection, the","words":[["vessels",167.24,167.74],["known",167.74,168.42],["as",168.42,168.74],["pommenders.",168.74,169.44],["I've",170.3,170.62],["brought",170.62,170.84],["out",170.84,171.16],["one",171.16,171.42],["ornament",171.42,171.78],["from",171.78,172.12],["the",172.12,172.26],["collection,",172.26,172.62],["the",173.04,173.18]]},{"start":173.18,"end":178.08,"text":"oldest one in fact, from the 14th century, which I'll pass round for you to sample.","words":[["oldest",173.18,173.42],["one",173.42,173.7],["in",173.7,173.86],["fact,",173.86,174.18],["from",174.36,174.56],["the",174.56,174.7],["14th",174.7,175.28],["century,",175.28,175.6],["which",175.94,176.24],["I'll",176.24,176.56],["pass",176.56,176.8],["round",176.8,177.18],["for",177.18,177.36],["you",177.36,177.52],["to",177.52,177.64],["sample.",177.64,178.08]]},{"start":178.08,"end":184.98,"text":"These palminders are solid paste balls made of ambergris impregnated with fragrance.","words":[["These",178.08,179.44],["palminders",179.44,180.04],["are",180.04,180.18],["solid",180.18,180.62],["paste",180.62,180.98],["balls",180.98,181.44],["made",181.44,182.26],["of",182.26,182.44],["ambergris",182.44,183.1],["impregnated",183.1,184.24],["with",184.24,184.66],["fragrance.",184.66,184.98]]},{"start":185.78,"end":189.76,"text":"The name was derived from the French for apple of ambergris.","words":[["The",185.78,185.96],["name",185.96,186.14],["was",186.14,186.28],["derived",186.28,186.54],["from",186.54,186.86],["the",186.86,186.98],["French",186.98,187.32],["for",187.32,188.06],["apple",188.06,188.8],["of",188.8,189.08],["ambergris.",189.08,189.76]]},{"start":190.3,"end":195.86,"text":"They must have had a powerful aroma in those days because even now you can smell the fragrance.","words":[["They",190.3,190.82],["must",190.82,191.16],["have",191.16,191.42],["had",191.42,191.58],["a",191.58,191.66],["powerful",191.66,192.24],["aroma",192.24,192.68],["in",192.68,192.88],["those",192.88,193.02],["days",193.02,193.32],["because",193.32,193.84],["even",193.84,194.24],["now",194.24,194.62],["you",194.62,194.86],["can",194.86,195.02],["smell",195.02,195.32],["the",195.32,195.5],["fragrance.",195.5,195.86]]},{"start":197.44,"end":203.4,"text":"Now during the medieval period, basically up until the 16th century, perfumes not only","words":[["Now",197.44,197.8],["during",197.8,198.2],["the",198.2,198.38],["medieval",198.38,198.7],["period,",198.7,199.22],["basically",199.6,200.12],["up",200.12,200.44],["until",200.44,200.7],["the",200.7,200.94],["16th",200.94,201.8],["century,",201.8,201.8],["perfumes",202.2,202.82],["not",202.82,203.18],["only",203.18,203.4]]},{"start":203.4,"end":208.26,"text":"major surrounding smells sweeter, they were believed to have other special properties.","words":[["major",203.4,203.82],["surrounding",203.82,204.32],["smells",204.32,204.86],["sweeter,",204.86,205.28],["they",205.8,205.94],["were",205.94,206.08],["believed",206.08,206.48],["to",206.48,206.82],["have",206.82,207.0],["other",207.0,207.28],["special",207.28,207.74],["properties.",207.74,208.26]]},{"start":209.08,"end":214.5,"text":"Researchers in the 19th century revealed that in medieval times, people thought perfumes","words":[["Researchers",209.08,209.48],["in",209.48,209.92],["the",209.92,210.0],["19th",210.0,211.0],["century",211.0,211.0],["revealed",211.0,211.82],["that",211.82,212.08],["in",212.08,212.24],["medieval",212.24,212.48],["times,",212.48,213.02],["people",213.34,213.56],["thought",213.56,213.9],["perfumes",213.9,214.5]]},{"start":214.5,"end":221.74,"text":"could help overcome all kinds of bodily ills. But only recently, researchers at our museum","words":[["could",214.5,214.78],["help",214.78,215.06],["overcome",215.06,215.5],["all",215.5,215.88],["kinds",215.88,216.16],["of",216.16,216.48],["bodily",216.48,216.86],["ills.",216.86,217.4],["But",218.34,218.68],["only",218.68,219.22],["recently,",219.22,219.74],["researchers",220.3,220.84],["at",220.84,221.22],["our",221.22,221.34],["museum",221.34,221.74]]},{"start":221.74,"end":226.84,"text":"have found that they were also believed to significantly raise the spirits of the wearer.","words":[["have",221.74,222.0],["found",222.0,222.36],["that",222.36,222.82],["they",222.82,222.94],["were",222.94,223.08],["also",223.08,223.38],["believed",223.38,223.74],["to",223.74,223.98],["significantly",223.98,224.6],["raise",224.6,225.08],["the",225.08,225.38],["spirits",225.38,225.9],["of",225.9,226.28],["the",226.28,226.42],["wearer.",226.42,226.84]]},{"start":226.84,"end":234.44,"text":"Turning now to some more technical details, with the advent of liquid perfume from the","words":[["Turning",226.84,228.28],["now",228.28,228.7],["to",228.7,228.94],["some",228.94,229.16],["more",229.16,229.36],["technical",229.36,229.8],["details,",229.8,230.42],["with",231.08,231.36],["the",231.36,231.52],["advent",231.52,231.98],["of",231.98,232.5],["liquid",232.5,233.0],["perfume",233.0,233.5],["from",233.5,234.32],["the",234.32,234.44]]},{"start":234.44,"end":240.88,"text":"mid-18th century, craftsmen had to use precision techniques to ensure there was an airtight","words":[["mid",234.44,234.62],["-18th",234.62,235.56],["century,",235.56,235.56],["craftsmen",236.08,236.7],["had",236.7,237.0],["to",237.0,237.24],["use",237.24,237.52],["precision",237.52,238.08],["techniques",238.08,238.78],["to",238.78,239.34],["ensure",239.34,239.78],["there",239.78,240.04],["was",240.04,240.22],["an",240.22,240.36],["airtight",240.36,240.88]]},{"start":240.88,"end":242.24,"text":"seal on the container.","words":[["seal",240.88,241.38],["on",241.38,241.74],["the",241.74,241.86],["container.",241.86,242.24]]},{"start":243.02,"end":248.24,"text":"It is clear that however beautiful these seemingly fragile objects were, they were","words":[["It",243.02,243.22],["is",243.22,243.36],["clear",243.36,243.7],["that",243.7,244.02],["however",244.02,244.4],["beautiful",244.4,244.98],["these",244.98,245.28],["seemingly",245.28,245.82],["fragile",245.82,246.36],["objects",246.36,246.94],["were,",246.94,247.34],["they",247.88,248.04],["were",248.04,248.24]]},{"start":248.24,"end":254.04,"text":"essentially utilitarian, designed to stop the extremely valuable substances inside","words":[["essentially",248.24,248.74],["utilitarian,",248.74,249.64],["designed",250.1,250.5],["to",250.5,251.0],["stop",251.0,251.4],["the",251.4,251.6],["extremely",251.6,252.22],["valuable",252.22,252.78],["substances",252.78,253.4],["inside",253.4,254.04]]},{"start":254.04,"end":255.52,"text":"them from evaporating.","words":[["them",254.04,254.32],["from",254.32,254.8],["evaporating.",254.8,255.52]]},{"start":260.84,"end":267.72,"text":"Let's turn now to have a look at some of the key developments in perfume containers in the last 200 years or so.","words":[["Let's",260.84,261.44],["turn",261.44,261.72],["now",261.72,262.12],["to",262.12,262.34],["have",262.34,262.52],["a",262.52,262.62],["look",262.62,262.76],["at",262.76,262.94],["some",262.94,263.12],["of",263.12,263.26],["the",263.26,263.4],["key",263.4,263.7],["developments",263.7,264.18],["in",264.18,264.56],["perfume",264.56,264.9],["containers",264.9,265.44],["in",265.44,266.06],["the",266.06,266.16],["last",266.16,266.46],["200",266.46,266.76],["years",266.76,267.28],["or",267.28,267.5],["so.",267.5,267.72]]},{"start":268.64,"end":273.26,"text":"From the late 18th century onwards, the vinaigrette came into vogue.","words":[["From",268.64,269.18],["the",269.18,269.32],["late",269.32,269.52],["18th",269.52,270.04],["century",270.04,270.34],["onwards,",270.34,270.82],["the",271.38,271.46],["vinaigrette",271.46,272.36],["came",272.36,272.68],["into",272.68,272.92],["vogue.",272.92,273.26]]},{"start":273.88,"end":280.46,"text":"The vinaigrette was a miniature box which opened on a hinge containing a tiny sponge soaked with perfume.","words":[["The",273.88,274.06],["vinaigrette",274.06,274.62],["was",274.62,274.72],["a",274.72,274.92],["miniature",274.92,275.22],["box",275.22,275.62],["which",275.62,275.96],["opened",275.96,276.54],["on",276.54,276.78],["a",276.78,276.92],["hinge",276.92,277.28],["containing",277.28,278.0],["a",278.0,278.28],["tiny",278.28,278.58],["sponge",278.58,279.22],["soaked",279.22,279.76],["with",279.76,280.04],["perfume.",280.04,280.46]]},{"start":281.18,"end":284.94,"text":"This was placed under a grill through which you could smell the fragrance.","words":[["This",281.18,281.54],["was",281.54,281.7],["placed",281.7,281.96],["under",281.96,282.32],["a",282.32,282.54],["grill",282.54,282.8],["through",282.8,283.44],["which",283.44,283.68],["you",283.68,283.8],["could",283.8,283.94],["smell",283.94,284.34],["the",284.34,284.6],["fragrance.",284.6,284.94]]},{"start":284.94,"end":291.16,"text":"It was widely used to carry the highly corrosive scent known as vinegar water, hence the name.","words":[["It",284.94,285.82],["was",285.82,285.96],["widely",285.96,286.28],["used",286.28,286.62],["to",286.62,286.78],["carry",286.78,287.1],["the",287.1,287.3],["highly",287.3,287.56],["corrosive",287.56,288.14],["scent",288.14,288.5],["known",288.5,289.1],["as",289.1,289.38],["vinegar",289.38,289.62],["water,",289.62,290.02],["hence",290.44,290.64],["the",290.64,290.88],["name.",290.88,291.16]]},{"start":291.8,"end":299.08,"text":"The outer box could be made of any material, but the lining was gold because the perfume tended to corrode other substances.","words":[["The",291.8,291.96],["outer",291.96,292.28],["box",292.28,292.74],["could",292.74,293.02],["be",293.02,293.2],["made",293.2,293.4],["of",293.4,293.54],["any",293.54,293.72],["material,",293.72,294.16],["but",294.54,294.78],["the",294.78,294.94],["lining",294.94,295.24],["was",295.24,295.52],["gold",295.52,295.88],["because",295.88,296.46],["the",296.46,296.62],["perfume",296.62,296.98],["tended",296.98,297.4],["to",297.4,297.62],["corrode",297.62,298.22],["other",298.22,298.48],["substances.",298.48,299.08]]},{"start":300.3,"end":305.58,"text":"From the mid-19th century, vinaigretes were replaced by more conventional bottles.","words":[["From",300.3,300.94],["the",300.94,301.08],["mid",301.08,301.24],["-19th",301.24,301.8],["century,",301.8,302.16],["vinaigretes",302.78,303.24],["were",303.24,303.38],["replaced",303.38,303.8],["by",303.8,304.14],["more",304.14,304.46],["conventional",304.46,305.08],["bottles.",305.08,305.58]]},{"start":306.14,"end":311.3,"text":"They were often made of glass, of course, but metal was another common material used,","words":[["They",306.14,306.32],["were",306.32,306.46],["often",306.46,306.78],["made",306.78,307.0],["of",307.0,307.14],["glass,",307.14,307.5],["of",307.72,307.74],["course,",307.74,308.1],["but",308.56,308.86],["metal",308.86,309.28],["was",309.28,309.52],["another",309.52,309.78],["common",309.78,310.28],["material",310.28,310.78],["used,",310.78,311.3]]},{"start":311.3,"end":316.5,"text":"produced, and very occasionally they were made of more unusual materials like horn.","words":[["produced,",311.3,311.38],["and",311.62,311.84],["very",311.84,312.3],["occasionally",312.3,312.88],["they",312.88,313.56],["were",313.56,313.68],["made",313.68,313.94],["of",313.94,314.08],["more",314.08,314.3],["unusual",314.3,314.88],["materials",314.88,315.54],["like",315.54,316.1],["horn.",316.1,316.5]]},{"start":317.38,"end":320.5,"text":"By now these beautiful objects were more affordable.","words":[["By",317.38,317.74],["now",317.74,318.02],["these",318.02,318.3],["beautiful",318.3,318.88],["objects",318.88,319.46],["were",319.46,319.74],["more",319.74,319.96],["affordable.",319.96,320.5]]},{"start":321.4,"end":326.28,"text":"This was the age of the Industrial Revolution in Western Europe, and the bottles were mass","words":[["This",321.4,321.8],["was",321.8,321.96],["the",321.96,322.14],["age",322.14,322.44],["of",322.44,322.6],["the",322.6,322.72],["Industrial",322.72,323.18],[